WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:02.199
Are you telling me the crown is three million
in debt?

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.820
Actually it's twenty trillion.

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.210
How could you let this happen?

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:08.050
Entitlement spending, a bunch of wars,

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.800
that bullet train to Riverrun didn't help.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:22.360
That is a big wall.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.120
And on the other side are the free folk?

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.360
No, over here, we call them wildlings.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.560
Right, and we hate them, because why?

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:33.640
Because they are a savage, backwards, knuckle-dragging
people.

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.520
They do whatever they please, they marry who
they want, they pay no taxes,

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.340
do you know they don't even have a real king?

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:42.500
Just some guy they voluntarily choose to follow.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.840
They're savages.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:47.520
So they built that wall-

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.160
No, we built the wall.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:57.660
Hodor [Repeated]

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:01.980
China [Repeated]

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:05.020
As the Invisible Hand of the King,

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:09.880
can I just suggest, once again, that we do
nothing?

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.920
Westeros is a shit show.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:16.310
We're massively in debt, people are starving,
we're constantly at war,

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.820
there's an oppressive surveillance apparatus,

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.719
and stifling religious dogma encroaching on
matters of state,

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.820
and draconian border restrictions.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.560
I mean, at this point I think it's fairly
clear that we suck at this governing thing,

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.180
right?

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:30.560
I am the King!

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:31.660
Again with the king stuff.

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:35.780
And in that vault is the Social Security Trust
Fund,

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:39.020
where all of the money goes that will one
day be paid out to retirees.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:42.800
Nothing.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:44.900
Yeah, it's pretty much a Ponzi scheme.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:48.780
We all agree that winter is coming but the
answer lies in innovation,

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:50.460
not in rationing wood and coal.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:53.440
Baratheons,

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.760
sigil: a stag,

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.580
words: ours is the fury.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.400
Good.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:58.800
The Democrats,

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.100
sigil: a donkey,

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:00.780
words:

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:03.380
it was Russia's fault?

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:06.820
No, a common saying but not their official
motto.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.560
There's always a victim.

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:10.380
Republicans,

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:11.560
sigil: an elephant,

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.240
words: hold my beer.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:14.460
No.

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.620
War, walls and Bibles?

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:18.360
No.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.180
Well, what do they believe?

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:21.660
I don't feel like I even know them anymore.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:24.400
You do know them, think.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:25.400
9/11.

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:27.240
Libertarians,

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:31.280
words: maximizing individual liberty and minimizing
statist incursions

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.980
through a robust deployment of the non-aggression
principle.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.739
And the sigil is a porcupine humping a pile
of money.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:42.280
No swords, no daggers, no crossbows,

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:44.300
no dark magic ghost babies.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:47.799
Some jackass blows up a sept and now we all
gotta take our shoes off.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.980
The night is dark and full of terrorists.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.440
If you have more than six ounces of wildfire,

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:56.220
you must place it in a transparent plastic
baggie.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:03:00.540
Trial by combat will be forbidden throughout
the seven kingdoms.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:02.060
The tradition is a brutish one.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.460
Right, but minimum sentencing for non-violent
drug offenders,

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:05.380
that's still a thing.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:06.980
Good people don't use milk of the poppy.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:08.660
God, you're such an asshole.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.200
I, I don't know,

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:14.280
I just think blowing up a sept in the middle
of your trial feels like,

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.780
obstruction of justice.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.060
So we built that wall,

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:18.620
Yeah.

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:22.140
and we paid for it

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.080
Oh yeah.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:28.580
to keep out the free folk

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:29.360
Right.

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.519
and their redheads

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:31.680
Uh huh.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.760
and now we're on this side of the wall.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:41.680
Yeah.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.340
Is there like a door?

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:46.320
There's probably a big door.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:47.100
There's probably 
a door.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:05.940
It shouldn't take a low income Dothraki four
years to get a hair braiding license.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.060
It's absurd.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.640
For the watch.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.200
For the watch.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:19.900
Peer pressure.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.740
Does due process mean nothing to you people?

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.820
I don't care, the unsullied can use whatever
bathroom they want.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:29.280
Why do we need to get involved in this?

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:34.880
Joffrey, Circei, Walder Frey...

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:40.920
Jeff Sessions, Chuck Schumer, The House Financial
Services Committee...

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:44.010
The names of every fucking person in Westeros.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.300
Only the ones I'm going to kill.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.920
That's what we're doing?!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:51.539
Do- No, I was just gonna write a letter.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.040
That's fucked up Arya.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:56.940
Things don't have to be planned in order to
be orderly.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.860
Complex systems can evolve from natural behavior,

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.349
and the result is more effective and more
efficient

00:05:03.349 --> 00:05:05.920
