00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.940
I really thought this was the libertarian
moment.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.530
Make Westeros great again.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:24.240
No.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:25.220
Grab 'em by the poppy?

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:25.920
No.

